heir <strong>challenge </strong>to learn more about the history of your store!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Mango Leaf Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/428b37b10acac362467cbefbf3897909681e69cf/header.jpg?t=1772825272","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TDB<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TDB<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TDB</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 Big Sur<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5, Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics should be enough<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> If you have a very potato PC/Mac and the game runs slowly on it, feel free to contact me so I can update this.</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3079770/1650277773/dbdd1e7867ddcfcae2cb92650dca6dba7a6c089b/1757353576/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757357498","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3079770/1650277773/dbdd1e7867ddcfcae2cb92650dca6dba7a6c089b/1757353576/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757357498","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3079770/1650277773/dbdd1e7867ddcfcae2cb92650dca6dba7a6c089b/1757353576/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757357498","id":257194661,"name":"Trailer 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257194661/184794cf55c177462a46239cea389445b919c214/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757357498"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3079770/2025489156/1c9df61fd96c96d6281dadc56dd4391680526826/1757352319/dash_av1.mpd?t=17573575